# Lark / Feishu (飞书) domains — routes Lark traffic through the Lark policy group.
# Loaded with priority ABOVE the built-in CN direct rules so the CN domains
# (feishu.cn / lark.cn / okr.cn ...) are not swallowed by RULE-SET,cn-domain /
# GEOSITE,cn and forced to DIRECT.
# Sources: v2fly geosite "feishu" (国内飞书) ∪ deezertidal Lark.list (国际 Lark +
# ByteDance backend infra). Comprehensive superset, deduped + sorted.
